# RISCOF: the architectural test suite is ~1.7 GB and is fetched with
# `riscof arch-test --clone`, not vendored here.  riscof_work is run
# output.
# The suite is 1.7 GB and is fetched, not vendored.  Match it with and
# without a trailing slash: a local checkout is a directory, but pointing
# at an existing checkout elsewhere makes it a symlink, and the
# directory form does not match one.  A symlink here was committed once
# -- it held an absolute path into one machine's filesystem.
verif/riscof/riscv-arch-test
verif/riscof/riscv-arch-test/
verif/riscof/arch-test-3.5.3/
verif/riscof/riscof_work/
core.*
